  <CENTER><H1>Patch Message</H1></CENTER>
<H2>January 7th, 3:00pm</H2>
<BR>
<BR>
** Fan Faire **<BR>
<BR>
How would you like for your character to be forever immortalized in the world of Norrath? Winners of the Live Quest at the Dallas Fan Faire will have just that opportunity!<BR>
<BR>
The story of the Live Quest, including the names of each member of the winning team, will be implemented in the game! If you win, you will be able to hear of your adventures in game! You will be heralded throughout Norrath for your bravery, ingenuity and creativity in overcoming the obstacles set before you and emerging victorious!<BR>
<BR>
The Dallas Fan Faire takes place on January 25-26 at the Adam's Mark Hotel. If you have not registered yet, visit http://everquest.station.sony.com/fanfaire for more information. Don't delay! <BR>
<BR>
Cindy Archuleta<BR>
Community Relations Manager<BR>
Sony Online Entertainment<BR>
